      "text": "You can export a ZIP file containing all landmine decoy personalities, each in its own JSON file."
    },
    {
      "text": "To export landmine decoy personalities:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Miragemaker > Strategy Builder > Landmine.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          17
        ],
        [
          20,
          36
        ],
        [
          39,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Export.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "All landmine decoy personalities are downloaded to your system in a compressed (.zip) file.",
      "depth": 0
    }
